    skos:prefLabel 'river water relative to ground surface'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The liquid phase plus any dissolved material and suspended solids making up the body of rivers or streams, relative to the ground surface. Rivers and streams are defined as being upstream of the tidal limit.'@en ;
